===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|caesūra||cutting, hewing}}, from {{term|caesus|lang=la}}, perfect passive participle of {{m|la|caedō||I cut down, hew}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|caesurae}}

# A [[pause]] or [[interruption]] in a [[poem]], [[music]], building or other work of art.
# In Classical [[prosody]], using two words to divide a [[metrical]] [[foot]].

